            "review_title": "Review at Menya Yoshino Shoten Da Nang",
            "review_text": "1926yanks\nSeattle, Washington755 contributions\n0\nGreat Little Ramen Place\nMar 2025 • Friends\nThis small restaurant has a counter of about 10 seats & a couple small tables. They make their own noodles-the curly ones are best. The basic ramen is great, the spicy one not as good. The shredded beef bowl was also very tasty. The five of us enjoyed sitting at the counter & watching the cooks at work.\nWritten March 24, 2025",
