            "review_text": "boyle2808\nGlasgow, United Kingdom7 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely the best Ramen ever !\nMar 2025 • Couples\nExcellent food, lovely small restaurant and excellent staff. Without a doubt the best Ramen we have ever tasted. Would definitely recommend the beef-bone and thick white chicken ramen with the curly noodle and also the gyoza. All the food was fresh and full of flavour.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 18, 2025",
